# CODEOWNERS TEMPLATE — NOT ACTIVE IN BEAUTIFULREPO.
# Adapt this file and copy to .github/CODEOWNERS in YOUR repository.
# Replace every @YOUR-* value with a VERIFIED user or visible organization
# team having repository write access and agreement to review the paths.
# Last matching pattern wins; owners do not accumulate across lines.
# For two eligible owners on one pattern, put both on that SAME line.
# GitHub's CODEOWNERS patterns are case-sensitive and not full gitignore.
*                   @YOUR-REPO-OWNER
/docs/              @YOUR-DOCS-OWNER
/tools/             @YOUR-TOOLS-OWNER
/tests/             @YOUR-TOOLS-OWNER
/.github/CODEOWNERS @YOUR-REPO-OWNER
#
# Check provider syntax errors AND observed requests on a later non-draft PR.
# Review requests use the base branch's file; no approval is required
# unless repository protection/rulesets separately enforce it.
